#: src/shell/HelpPage.tsx
msgid "A report is stored with the conversation and answered with a reference you can quote to support. It does not change the conversation, suspend anyone or tell the model anything. If a report could not be stored you are told so, because a report that was never filed must not look like one that was."
msgstr "Un informe se guarda junto a la conversación y se responde con una referencia que puedes citar a soporte. No cambia la conversación, no suspende a nadie ni le dice nada al modelo. Si un informe no pudo guardarse, se te avisa, porque un informe que nunca se presentó no debe parecer uno que sí."

#: src/apps/admin/FlagsTab.tsx
